  "snippet": "#​621 — October 23, 2026 Read the Web Version Go Weekly Interactive Refactoring in gopls — LSP refactorings can't 'ask' you anything, so \"Add struct tags\" in gopls just guessed json and camelCase. gopls can now pop up di...",
